sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as order-service
    participant S as payment-service
    participant PSP as Provider
    participant R as Reconciler (every 20 s)
    O->>S: authorize
    S->>PSP: authorize
    S-->>O: 504 UNKNOWN (deadline passed)
    O->>S: void
    S->>S: void_requested = true (status stays UNKNOWN)
    PSP->>PSP: …authorises late
    R->>PSP: lookup(order 7)
    PSP-->>R: Approved(ref)
    R->>S: AUTHORIZED, then void at once (void requested)
    S->>PSP: void(order 7)
    S->>S: VOIDED · attempts AUTHORIZE:TIMEOUT, RECONCILE:SUCCESS, VOID:SUCCESS
